## 🧮 Example Calculation

For:

```text
Principal = 10,000
Rate = 5%
Time = 2 years
```

The Simple Interest is:

```text
SI = (10000 × 5 × 2) / 100
SI = 1000
```

Therefore:

```text
Total Amount = 10000 + 1000
Total Amount = 11000
```

